          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_unit_hidden",
            hidden: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Shan Taum",
            text: _("Now now now, what do we have here? Collaborating with the enemy again just like your disgusting father, are you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Collaborating with the humans, pfff. You’re one to talk. What are you doing here, Shan Taum?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Shan Taum",
            text: _("I am here to do to you what I did to your father."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("So you did kill my father then."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("What did I tell you, Kapou’e?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Earl Lanbec'h",
            portrait: "portraits/lanbech.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("Ha ha! Good work Shan Taum. That will teach them. Attack, boys! I want Dorest recaptured by sunset."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("Hold, Earl Lanbec’h. I have reached an agreement with these orcs. Since your army has been the aggressor, you must immediately disperse it and withdraw from orcish territory. Once that is done, then Kapou’e will give you back Dorest and call off the horde. I have had dealings with Kapou’e’s father before, and I believe his blood will be trustworthy. And if that isn’t enough, then we are here to protect you in case he violates the pact."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Earl Lanbec'h",
            portrait: "portraits/lanbech.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("You and your damned compromises can go to hell! Your beloved Kapou’e will be joining you shortly."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("You leave us no choice but to take military action against you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Earl Lanbec'h",
            portrait: "portraits/lanbech.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("Ha ha! Very funny, Howgarth. Look around you. You are going to be dead as soon as my orc friend here gives the order. And then your men will automatically assume that Kapou’e tricked and killed you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("Not today, my friend. (<i>Whistles</i>)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_26",
            type: "Gryphon Master",
            side: 6,
            x: 46,
            y: 21,
          },
